1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,308
A breakout means more when the structure is already rising,

2
00:00:03,358 --> 00:00:05,429
and when a crowd turns up for it.

3
00:00:05,897 --> 00:00:07,237
Add three single signals:

4
00:00:07,257 --> 00:00:11,146
market structure, Bollinger position, and the heavy-volume candle.

5
00:00:11,810 --> 00:00:14,137
Line one: market structure is up.

6
00:00:14,187 --> 00:00:17,793
Line two: the close is at or above the upper Bollinger band.

7
00:00:17,843 --> 00:00:21,109
Line three: today's volume is at least twice the usual.

8
00:00:31,163 --> 00:00:33,575
Save it, and run it on your equities,

9
00:00:33,625 --> 00:00:37,146
as of the twenty-eighth of April 2023.

10
00:00:50,525 --> 00:00:53,833
Yes means all three are true on the latest finished candle.

11
00:00:53,883 --> 00:00:56,274
Each No shows which piece is missing.
